      55.17,
      411.54,
      295.23,
      469.5
    ],
    "text": "I, Munasingha Kariyawasam Appuhamilage Don SomadasaGunawardana, Minister of Lands, hereby declare, under Sub-section(1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land describedbelow is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under theprovisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      483.54,
      295.23,
      565.5
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land in total extent of about 1.7455 Hectaredepicted as Lot \u2018A\u2019 in Advance Tracing No. Mu/MLL/2014/284 of27.09.2014, prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys-Kilinochchi District, situated in the Village of Nayaru in the GramaNiladhari Division No. MN/83 of Chemmalai East in the DivisionalSecretary\u2019s Division of Maritimepattu in Mullaittivu District inNorthern Province and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.17,
      370.98,
      547.2,
      428.94
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Nayarukani \u2013 Extent: 1.7455 HectareNorth: Nayarukani open waste land and Reservation forSea; East: Reservation for Sea and Nayaru Lagoon; South: NayaruLagoon and Nayarukani Low Jungle; West: Nayarukani Low Jungle,Path and Nayarukani open waste land.",
